OL,3,GNEWSAMP apologises over bullying and
OL,4,Aharassment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MP for Folkestone and Hythe was
OL,7,Ffound by the Parliamentary Commissioner
OL,8,Ffor Standards to have committed the
OL,9,Fbreach after a constituency staff
OL,10,Fmember complained he "behaved towards
OL,11,F[her] in an overbearing and belittling
OL,12,Fmanner".
OL,14,FVaughan said on Thursday he accepted
OL,15,Fthe findings in full.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
